  <steps>
    <step order="1">Re-verify ADR-046 is still the reserved messaging slot and ADR-047 is untaken (reserved for notification-spine): `ls .claude/adr/ADR-04*` + read the placeholder + `.claude/adr/INDEX.md`.</step>
    <step order="2">Read `spec.md` FR-17 + §Technical Constraints (ADR list + MUST/MUST NOT) + §ADR Tensions + design §10/§14.7 for the scope inputs. Read the email-r4 task 005 POML as the authoring mirror.</step>
    <step order="3">Read `ADR-045` (the spine — cite + mirror structure) + the neighbor ADRs (034, 028, 024, 027, 032, 004/036, 007, 015, 038) so the Related section cites them correctly. Consume task 002's private-grant decision if available (else cite it as the pending mechanism).</step>
    <step order="4">Author `.claude/adr/ADR-046-acs-messaging-channel.md` (concise): Status (Accepted, dated), Context (ACS net-new; second channel on ADR-045), Decision covering the six parts with MUST/MUST NOT pulled from spec §MUST Rules / §MUST NOT Rules (ACS-transport/Dataverse-record; server-only token minting/no client SDK; ingestor seam; membership-as-projection; thread model + `IThreadResolver`; retention-minimized per-customer resource; no Activities/OOB-email/portal/Teams-chat; AI never decides privilege), Consequences, Related.</step>
    <step order="5">Author `docs/adr/ADR-046-acs-messaging-channel.md` (full): same decision + Alternatives Considered (e.g., ACS composites vs headless — deferred/rejected per design §8.5; thread grouping-key options A/B/C per design §6.1; capture-on-event vs persist-on-send for outbound; SignalR-in-R1 vs polling) + fuller rationale + consequences + revision log.</step>
    <step order="6">Flip the `.claude/adr/INDEX.md` ADR-046 row Placeholder → Accepted (concise summary of the six-part decision). Update `docs/adr/INDEX.md` with the ADR-046 row.</step>
    <step order="7">Ensure ADR-046 is reachable from root `CLAUDE.md` §17 (via the ADR INDEX row or a direct pointer). Add the required `.claude/CHANGELOG.md` entry.</step>
    <step order="8">Run `/adr-check` against `spec.md` — confirm ADR-046 has no contradiction with existing ADRs (esp. ADR-045 additivity, ADR-028 token minting, ADR-034 membership) + passes constraint validation. Confirm existing cross-references still resolve and ADR-047 was not claimed.</step>
    <step order="9">Update `tasks/TASK-INDEX.md` (007 ✅) + `current-task.md`; confirm dependents 020 + 021 unblocked. Record decisions (final ADR structure, any alternative explicitly rejected).</step>
  </steps>

