    <criterion testable="true">The Decision codifies all six parts: ACS-transport/Dataverse-record; uniform server-side token minting (no client SDK); the `ICommunicationChannelIngestor` seam; membership-as-projection (open ADR-034 / private record-sharing grant); thread model + `IThreadResolver`; retention-minimized per-customer resource.</criterion>
