  <notes>
    MAIN-SESSION ONLY (§3): do not delegate to an Agent-tool sub-agent — the `.claude/adr/` write would be denied. If a parallel agent reports "Edit denied on `.claude/...`" that is the boundary working correctly.

    Mirror email-r4 task 005 (ADR-045) exactly in workflow + structure — this is its sibling ADR for the second channel. ADR-046 EXTENDS ADR-045; frame it as additive, not a new pipeline.

    Blocks 020 (channel sender/archiver cite the ADR) + 021 (the ingestor seam this ADR codifies). Land it early in W0 so every ACS/thread wave has the anchor.

    ADR-047 is reserved for `notification-spine-r1` — the coordination sibling. Do not claim it; cite it as the reserved sibling.
  </notes>

